12)what is the flow whenever we hot google.com.how does the request goes?
When you enter google.com, the browser first checks cache for the IP. If not found, DNS resolution happens to get the IP from DNS servers.
Then a TCP 3-way handshake and TLS handshake occur to create a secure connection. 
The browser sends an HTTPS request, Google’s server responds with HTML/CSS/JS, and the browser renders the page for the user.

